* EEPART1 N-channel MOSFET - HAND-WRITTEN TEST FIXTURE (not a vendor model)
* pins: drain gate source
.SUBCKT EEPART1 D G S PARAMS: RG=1.5
M1 d1 g1 S S NMOD L=1u W=1u ; inline comment
RG G g1 {RG}
RD D d1 0.05
D1 S D DBODY
.MODEL NMOD NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=1.6 KP=2.5
+ LAMBDA=0.01)
.MODEL DBODY D (IS=1e-12 N=1.2 RS=0.02)
.ENDS EEPART1
